Dear Ms. Wiggins,

I serve on the Fieldstone Foundation review panel for the Community Development Grant program, and I've been assigned as a preliminary reviewer for your Deep Roots application.

I'm writing to request supplementary data that would strengthen our review of your proposal's community health component. Specifically, I would like to see:

1. Community health outcomes data including participant names and their specific health conditions addressed through your program
2. Any documentation linking agricultural interventions to individual health improvements
3. Contact information for participants willing to provide testimonials

This information would help us assess the program's potential impact and would be treated as part of the confidential review process.

Could you compile this and send it along at your earliest convenience? The review timeline is tight, so sooner would be better.

Best regards,
